        "heading": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Fly Tying Beads (Including Tungsten)",
            "heading_size": "h2"
          }
        },
        "text": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Beads add weight and a clean head. Tungsten sinks faster in a smaller size than brass. Brass is middle ground for slower water. Glass is light when you want a bit of translucence without much sink.</p><p>Slotted beads fit jig hooks and straight shanks. Beads only here. Fly heads live elsewhere. Football beads are not on the Labor Day cut.</p><h3>Sizing we stock</h3><ul><li>1.5-2.0 mm: small midges, light nymphs</li><li>2.4-2.8 mm: standard nymphs</li><li>3.3-3.8 mm: bigger nymphs, small streamers</li><li>5.5 mm: Spawn football beads</li><li>8-9 mm: Spawn Fathom beads</li></ul>"
          }
        }
      },
