      "blocks": {
        "q1": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Slotted vs non-slotted beads?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Slotted beads open to the side so they seat on jig hooks and straight shanks. Through-hole beads slide over a conventional eye.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q2": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Tungsten vs brass or glass — sink rate?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Tungsten is denser, so it sinks faster at a smaller diameter. Brass is moderate. Glass is light and a bit translucent.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q3": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How do I match bead size to hook?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Use the sizing list on this page. Seat the bead flush behind the eye without crowding the thorax.</p>"
          }
        }
